    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b8d076805d7cc7e9549cbe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是西沙里奥。\n请多关照，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8c9b0a6740499354a9a8a1572d0915ec353453075368199a48aee7b8e681ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df281098c4e6e990bc45cd7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "愿与我共同，成为基石吗。\n为了那未曾谋面的——未来的基石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c495190dc5e09bc3b6b4849547a06365e0e7012a98a3a5f6e818972cfd00f087",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a273a37c8f9f327644b13bc7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "改良指导方法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3282abf1f001d2067e5b3155df7df0c37f5d419665b270735496da43f0cff9a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38a711e0f5a573958fefce1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e79ff6e4b72308c2fe12594d8204564069d86bc4a7cf8215e4c687cb662fe05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9d07ff9289aa39288e6265",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "献上更多的祝福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d9cf4e9ffed1a5b476a94e892561625048e10e6bed87a9809a45070a1aebb96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77261bedb39aac149d26a91e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这条路没有尽头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4a109c2d95181b2fb78efaf8b9c142d949097e23b1a32cf24294d9e2be72fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d00345ba89656f7f1f28136",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这条连绵不断的大河——\n您愿意与我一同前行吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbed0894272946ae44f9548be96aa2a6fc0b6fa5f75b5e6380b14205ba98e30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c58c631003b8468e88667b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是西沙里奥。让我们共赴未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8ba0c15ba32cbef91c73a82b79fdcc7f715217c9c65a9915a11b4ed8342444",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/95010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08bc555300d06714ba4eccb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到『恋爱』，班上很受欢迎的\n少女漫画里，有个虽然粗鲁但\n内心温柔的人……让我觉得有点亲切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d0a7a59a38b8585b82f0e82dd22f1ab2eab4f9950b95ba2ed829bf16fc5860",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "400005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1111/400005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434ba4fb73f006f672997fdc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让我想起了，第一次和妈妈一起\n去比赛教室的那一天——\n青草的气息让人感觉……很舒服",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d542cde18d511f7edbf03a1719428c1cc7f3b91ec877eb94f8bcf9edaa00278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "400007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1111/400007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a3d3dec0ed883f7b81567c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活动任务，已经设定好\n目标点了吗？\n让我们一步一步，按计划完成吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57ea5bc73e65ac43641a4e98a6a8cea842f481c0a5506fdec9bd48a50462aa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "400012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1111/400012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:978cbcaf1470cc30bb9a871e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。\n请不要忘记领取你的努力成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fae334c3e8fbf2eed5c74f8f7f80172f706a1e872c3daefad76e42ba3ba7aa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "400013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1111/400013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1295ffa6028348b08c08d087",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家，上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1549c847d674bffca5b8a80dea6fddd5ebfcad7057e99d588df7830057c80bcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "1000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/1000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60d847ef90c002dad967d4a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说你总说自己胆小，\r\n但谨慎也是一种美德！若是跟勇敢的\r\n我结合起来…就是完美无缺了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b694f9308a74f163048674b2b5039ffc19c0397d795ea7f1262f72899c240145",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/10000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a79882052b3965fd4c0d79",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我出门了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a95107359ba3a438b9b1f2f7df2f3ee5e54672fa6c9f4a304d9c32dc1ebbb35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "100000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e194b84233fd7184747c63c7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "100001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/100001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9146c0c6337c7f6cc8bbcb2b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你就像泰迪熊一样。\r\n软绵绵的，紧紧包容我紧绷的心，\r\n治愈着我…对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fe3781e27eeb8b03496e8530d944686ab2260cb80b21ea0d3c5fe6f81d8e513",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37849a0054d59075013358be",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我喜欢你的眼睛。虽然宁静平和\r\n…却能敏锐地看透本质。我大概也\r\n已经被你看透了吧…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5424879f3da3c0462052edab715251327ebc3ed2e7c58fe488b5f2e4e4f4682f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83dc10e31566c4dbb53e76f4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“一年之计在于春！”真是句好话呢。\n是年初才更要全力以赴——\n那么，登山的准备做好了吗？",
